{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And he went.</b> The Israelites were dwelling in many cities, for they were numerous, and all were called the land of Rameses. Perhaps this was in a different city:" "<b>A daughter of Levi.</b> An Israelite's daughter, and she was his father's sister. And he who says that seedlings of a field sown in another field will succeed is not speaking correctly — only in that same field itself they will not succeed properly, for the essential prohibition of incest is that Israel be holy."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {0 "Resolved the duplicated phrase ישראל ישראל in the source as a single reading; the first appears to be an editorial insertion of the lemma referent."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:53.957450413Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}